<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@/~chp_III__cl_35> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 47A(2) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “paragraph 9(1)(c)” the words “subsection 9(3)”."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@/~chp_II> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@> .
