<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@/~chp_II__cl_21__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1A) For the purposes of this section, a company shall furnish to the Director General a return in the prescribed form on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with section 152A.”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@> .
