<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@/~chp_II__cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 4B the following section: “Gains or proﬁ ts from a business arising from stock in trade parted with by any element of compulsion 4C. For the purpose of paragraph 4(a), gains or profits from a business shall include an amount receivable arising from stock in trade parted with by any element of compulsion including on requisition or compulsory acquisition or in a similar manner.”. Amendment of section 6"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@/~chp_II> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@> .
