<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_42> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 83(1) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph (ba) the following paragraph: “(bb) providing for the scope and procedure applied in relation to any arrangement made under section 71A;”. Amendment of First Schedule"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@> .
