<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_50> <https://schema.org/text> "Sections 51 and 52 come into operation on the coming into operation of this Act. Amendment of section 21"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/eng@> .
